# DirectCare Indy

Before any code or content change, read [`docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md`](../../docs/PROJECT_MEMORY.md). It is the strategic source of truth.

- Keep [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md) as **pointers** — do not duplicate full strategy into agent files or rules.
- Implementation queue: [`docs/CODEX_BACKLOG.md`](../../docs/CODEX_BACKLOG.md); workflow: [`docs/CODEX_WORKFLOW.md`](../../docs/CODEX_WORKFLOW.md).

## Guardrails

- **Single clinic:** 7911 N. Michigan Rd., Indianapolis, IN 46268 — no “Find a provider near you.”
- **Quiz is secondary** — no global header quiz CTA; do not spam quiz CTAs on audience cards or sticky bars.
- **Brokers** stay out of main nav (`lib/nav.ts`).
- **Do not implement** GA4/GTM production setup, HSA/FSA gates, or production scheduler env vars unless explicitly requested.
- **Demo scheduler:** use `getDpcQuizScheduleLink()` fallbacks; keep links dev-safe.
- **Pricing:** import from `lib/content/membership-pricing.ts` — no hardcoded plans, calculators, fake testimonials, or “unlimited visits.”
- **No-touch:** `app/api/**`, `app/join/**`, env files, Hint Health — unless explicitly approved.

After meaningful code changes: `npm run build` and `npm run lint`.
